  "below_min_pixels": {
   "n": 28,
   "n_in_paired": 28,
   "mechanism": "image area below the 65,536 px min_pixels floor, so the DEVICE upscaled to the floor and the cloud (floor 4,096) did not",
   "axis_affected": "ACCURACY AND TTFT. The two models were shown DIFFERENT PIXELS, so a 2x2 cell on one of these reflects partly that the device got a larger rendering of the same photo. This is NOT only a token-count issue."
  },
  "overlap": {
